  'chiller-breakdown-delays-surgery-steve-biko-hospital-2026-10-29',
  'Chiller breakdown delays major surgery at Steve Biko Hospital',
  'Community', '2026-10-29', 'Pretoria Rekord', 'https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/news-headlines/local-news/2026/10/29/chiller-failure-at-steve-biko-academic-hospital-causes-major-surgeries-to-be-postponed/',
  'Chiller failures have pushed operating theatre temperatures too high for major orthopaedic surgery at Pretoria''s Steve Biko Academic Hospital, Gauteng Health has confirmed.',
  'Operating theatres at Steve Biko Academic Hospital in Pretoria have been running too hot for some surgery after chiller units serving the theatre complex broke down. The Democratic Alliance''s Gauteng health spokesperson, Madeleine Hicklin, said theatre temperatures had risen well above 20 degrees, far higher than the roughly 18 degrees generally needed to limit infection risk during long operations.

Because of the heat, major orthopaedic operations such as hip and knee replacements and complicated fracture repairs have been postponed, while emergency surgery and shorter procedures continue as usual. The Gauteng Department of Health, through spokesperson Steve Mabona, said it was aware of the strain this places on patients, staff and students, and that patients on the affected waiting lists are being assessed according to clinical need, with some referred to other public hospitals in the meantime.

The department said five of the broken chillers will be repaired within six weeks, and one further unit will be replaced within three months. Hicklin said the breakdown should not have been allowed to happen again, and the DA has asked Premier Panyaza Lesufi to hold Health MEC Faith Mazibuko and Infrastructure Development MEC Jacob Mamabolo to account, including questions on what earlier repair work to the same equipment cost.',
  NULL, NULL, NULL,
  '["https://www.citizen.co.za/rekord/news-headlines/local-news/2026/10/29/chiller-failure-at-steve-biko-academic-hospital-causes-major-surgeries-to-be-postponed/", "https://iol.co.za/news/south-africa/2026-10-28-steve-biko-hospital-surgery-delays-gauteng-health-maps-out-plan-to-fix-theatre-cooling-systems/", "https://thestar.co.za/news/2026-10-29-steve-biko-hospital-air-conditioning-failures-leave-patients-waiting-weeks-for-surgery/", "https://dagauteng.org.za/2026/10/steve-biko-hospitals-repeated-air-conditioning-failures-leave-orthopaedic-patients-suffering"]',
  'agent'
);
